[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598247568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101665#issuecomment-2598247568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101665","id":2598247568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a3hyQ","user":{"login":"Kalamster","id":115049978,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtuF-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/115049978?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster","html_url":"https://github.com/Kalamster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kalamster/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T12:20:30Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T12:20:30Z","body":"For me, the warning is also triggered by pausing in the new game mode in Beta1. I get several thousand of these warnings in a minute or so because of a high number of hidden CSG nodes I use for prototyping, but keep hidden when running the game.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598247568/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599104062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101665#issuecomment-2599104062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101665","id":2599104062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a6y4-","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T20:03:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T20:03:04Z","body":"This is happening because we always reset physics interpolation when pausing:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9630d4e2fc1d0fdef6f46f24e236548549f31d49/scene/main/node.cpp#L190-L194\n\nI agree we should suppress/avoid the warning in this case, when it's not caused by user error. I'm not sure where is the best place to do it. cc @lawnjelly ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2599104062/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600792993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101665#issuecomment-2600792993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101665","id":2600792993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bBPOh","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T10:09:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T10:17:53Z","body":"These warnings don't seem present in 3.x, it looks like @rburing added them in #92391.\n\nI don't know if these existed historically in 3.x and were since were removed, or if they never existed there.\n\nIt looks like you could:\n* Remove the warning.\n* Add a `if (_is_vi_visible()` in the `NOTIFICATION_PAUSED` for 4.x.\n\nBut I'm not sure it needs a warning (hence not being one in 3.x) - there are other scenarios where it might be unwanted, such as turning off and on interpolation globally, or recursive resets.\n\nAdditionally for physics interpolation warnings in general it is better to use `PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_NODE_WARNING` and `PHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_WARNING` macros, as these are anti-spamming.\n\nThey also don't call `GLOBAL_GET(\"debug/settings/physics_interpolation/enable_warnings\")` all the time, as this could be an expensive call. It is far cheaper to check the condition _before_ checking the GLOBAL, and the GLOBAL is only checked every 15 seconds or so. If it was to be checked all the time by some alternative method, it should be cached.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600792993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600799015","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101665#issuecomment-2600799015","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101665","id":2600799015,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bBQsn","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T10:26:07Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T10:26:07Z","body":"@lawnjelly The warnings existed historically in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/a4c0e2ecce2aa74ae13a60ed5a20847f22705d9b and were removed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/5162efbfe9daddb9b30c15c906890e0ea4e4213a. I'll remove them then :-)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600799015/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600803430","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101665#issuecomment-2600803430","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101665","id":2600803430,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bBRxm","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-19T10:39:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-19T10:39:18Z","body":"Ah that sounds sensible. 👍 \nMaybe I noticed them being spammy in 3.x for similarish reasons.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2600803430/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"ey